Z||000000||KRMFiero||02-18-2001||11:40 AM||||I got my '84 Cradle/Engine Assembly out in 2 days. I just wanted to tell people who are afraid to take there engine out that it is extreamly easy,  I did it in 2 days (1 night, 1 full day) I did it all myself (I am 16).<P>I'm so happy, But know I have to figure out how to remove engine from the cradle (any one knoe how lol)<P>As soon as i disconnect the engine from Tranny I can pick up the Caddy engine and attemp to install that heh<P>I'm wicked happy i got it out  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Kyle<P>------------------<BR>1984 Pontiac Fiero 2M4 SE<P>  <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/~Physcokyle/fiero.jpg"> ||||reg||1
