Z||000006||KRMFiero||02-19-2001||08:08 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MooCow:<BR><B>Hey I would like to know what Caddy engine you are useing as well?  Are you making your own mounts or getting them from someone?  Also are you doing the install yourself?  Also how much do you think the install is going to cost after it is all done?<BR>More info the better.<P>                            Thanks Ken<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Are you planning to do this?  I will be using a 1988 4.5L Caddy engine. I might make my own mounts BUT Bubbajoexx says he has some for me (Just waiting for him to give me a price) I am doing this install myself (well I'll probley have my dad help me, but i want to try to do everything i can myself)...  I am estimating under a 1000$ including engine and eveything. I am getting the engine for 400$ /w computer and harness.  Then i will need to get a mini starter and oil cooler, and some hose's and stuff   that should be around 500$ for that stuff<P><BR>Kyle<P>||||reg||1
